[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31500100_02_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31500100_02_0010","text":"制作人……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31500100_02_0020","text":"今天的甜花……\n是恶魔……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31500100_02_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31500100_02_0030","text":"所以，可能会……做坏事……\n嘿嘿嘿……你要小心哦……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31500100_02_0040","text":"哦，那可真吓人啊\n我会小心的……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31500100_02_0050","text":"……不过……\n恶魔……会做什么呢……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31500100_02_0051","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31500100_02_0060","text":"还有……\n为什么甜花，会是恶魔……呢……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31500100_02_0070","text":"这、也是啊……\n那个——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31500100_02_0080","text":"啊，可是……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31500100_02_0090","text":"小菜……\n穿的是天使的……衣服……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31500100_02_0091","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31500100_02_0100","text":"那甜花就……\n当恶魔……好了……！"}]
